<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mars Odyssey Orbiter - By The Numbers</title>
<script>
window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };
</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif;
    width: 1280px;
    height: 720px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 40% 60%, #b03a2e 0%, #a8352c 25%, #8a3350 45%, #5a3a72 65%, #3d4a8a 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .header {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 35px;
  }

  .header h1 {
    font-size: 46px;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  .header h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    margin: 8px 0 0 0;
    color: #f0e0e0;
  }

  .nasa-logo {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    right: 30px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .nasa-text {
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-right: 10px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .nasa-badge {
    width: 55px;
    height: 55px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0b3d91;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #fff;
  }

  .content {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 560px;
  }

  .column {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    width: 400px;
  }

  .left-col {
    left: 40px;
  }

  .right-col {
    right: 40px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .stat-block {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  .stat-block:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .stat-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .right-col .stat-row {
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .big-number {
    font-size: 62px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .relay-block .stat-label {
    text-align: right;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .relay-block .big-number {
    font-size: 62px;
  }

  .relay-flex {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .footer-url {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 22px;
    left: 40px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .footer-date {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 22px;
    right: 40px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #f0e0e0;
  }

  .placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    top: 250px;
    left: 440px;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-style: italic;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="nasa-logo">
    <div class="nasa-text">National Aeronautics and<br>Space Administration</div>
    <div class="nasa-badge">NASA</div>
  </div>

  <div class="header">
    <h1>Mars Odyssey Orbiter</h1>
    <h2>BY THE NUMBERS</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <div class="column left-col">
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="big-number">23</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Years<br>In Orbit</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="big-number">17.1</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Terabits of<br>Data Returned</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="big-number">1.33</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Terabits of<br>Data Relayed<br>from Mars Surface Missions</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Mars Odyssey Orbiter spacecraft illustration over Mars, centered]</div>

    <div class="column right-col">
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="big-number">100,000</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Orbits</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="big-number">1.4</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Million<br>Images Taken</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-block relay-block">
        <div class="relay-flex">
          <span class="stat-label">Relay Support<br>for</span>
          <span class="big-number">6</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-label" style="margin-top:4px;">Mars Missions</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-url">science.nasa.gov/mission/odyssey</div>
  <div class="footer-date">Updated June 2024</div>

</body>
</html>
